#83=IFCTASK('0kt5CAZFswCSSN8rTg65IN',#6,'External gate - Rev1 bring-up firmware and diagnostic tools','Versioned Rev1 pin map, flash/storage change, sensor addressing, charger source policy, USB-only latch-off recovery, rail sequencing/back-power prevention, fuel-gauge configuration and diagnostic capture ready. Dashboard/carportpy/proto compatible. Deliverables managed in software backlogs.','USERDEFINED','3.3',$,$,$,.F.,$,#82,.USERDEFINED.);
