#85=IFCTASK('1LVOCDBoF8pMM8N_TDTBdk',#6,'Bring up Rev1 PCBA with current-limited staged power','Supply currents/rails verified before radios; USB enumeration, debug recovery, sensor/mic/button/RGB, flash, reset/boot and UART tested. Record boot firmware, serial and measurement setup.','USERDEFINED','3.4',$,$,$,.F.,$,#84,.USERDEFINED.);
